  "releaseNotes": "* v3.1.0: Updated to Ktor 3.1.0. Transitive-dep floors bumped to match:\n          - com.squareup.okio:okio-jvm 3.9.1 -> 3.10.2\n          - org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-serialization-* 1.7.3 -> 1.8.1\n          - org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-io-core 0.5.4 -> 0.6.0\n          - org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-serialization-json-io 1.7.3 -> 1.8.1\n          - io.ktor:ktor-http-cio(:-jvm) added (new Ktor module)\n          - io.ktor:ktor-network(:-jvm) added (new Ktor module, required by ktor-http-cio)\n          - Nuget dependency change: dropped Xamarin.Kotlin.StdLib.Common/.Jdk7/.Jdk8 NuGet refs:\n            Kotlin 2.x folds these into the base kotlin-stdlib,\n            and Ktor 3.1.0 only declares a dep on kotlin-stdlib.\n            Base Xamarin.Kotlin.StdLib is retained, with nuget version tracking the native version.",
